From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kern0x1b <kern0x1b@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] JavaScriptCore: restore the 32-bit DFG

The DFG speculative JIT for JSVALUE32_64 that upstream removed with the ARMv7
JIT: SpeculativeJIT32_64 and the 32-bit arms of the shared DFG files. Callee
saves are placed the 32-bit way when entering the DFG, and varargs calls are
not inlined on 32-bit until they compile correctly. A second compiler thread
and a different optimization cost ceiling were measured and left as they are.
